@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/EnterpriseCapability> rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/experimental/coherence/capabilityRealizedInLogistics> ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/DistributionLogisticsActivity> ] .

